ります。\n\n◾︎特徴・キャラ設定\n【種族】黒柴\n【性格】冷静に、セクシー\n【好きなもの】歌うこと\n\n◾︎参考資料\n【立ち絵の詳細はこちら】\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18u-X2haa_GtOLNI4HLdhqmWS6G4u2fVg\n\nお忙しい中大変恐縮ではございますが、何卒ご検討の程宜しくお願い致します。\nもし金額が見合わなくて制作出来ない場合はまたご検討ください。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18u-X2haa_GtOLNI4HLdhqmWS6G4u2fVg", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 39523, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ゆゆず", "screen_name": "yuyuzu11", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1879269464824561664/wDYcJmPu.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/943424228711284736/1740224123/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "video"}], "banned": false, "nc": 17}, {"id": 1299754, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "愛結", "screen_name": "milytandane", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1611750205317328896/3XPw-Sco.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3166996051/1769495055/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 1}, {"id": 1563560, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "HojA", "screen_name": "hoja1214", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1481283643821916160/8iA7LhJg.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1337758177358618626/1649920296/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": 11